
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FreshVision AI in your research, please cite this repository."
title: "FreshVision AI: AI-Powered Fruit Quality Classification with Explainable Artificial Intelligence"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rsinchana-352005/FreshVision-AI"
abstract: >
  FreshVision AI is a research-oriented web application for
  fruit quality classification using MobileNetV2 and EfficientNetB0.
  It integrates Grad-CAM and LIME for explainable AI,
  model comparison, interactive analytics, and PDF report generation.
keywords:
  - Artificial Intelligence
  - Fruit Quality Classification
  - Deep Learning
  - Explainable AI
  - MobileNetV2
  - EfficientNetB0
  - Grad-CAM
  - LIME
